# Make a `Stack` a real object

I think this is one of the few marketplace concepts worth making canonical.

```text
Stack
 ├── input contract
 ├── components[]
 ├── execution order / DAG
 ├── expected cost
 ├── historical performance
 ├── compatible worker types
 └── output contract
