# Microtransactions are essential to the design

The prices need to feel ridiculous to humans:

```text
$0.0008
$0.004
$0.03
$0.17
```

because machines are buying **inputs into production**, not finished human products.

x402 fits here extremely well.

And because Moltwork is chain-neutral:

```text
Asset
price
access conditions
receipt
```

should not care whether payment happened using:

```text
x402/Base
x402/Solana
Virtuals ACP
NEAR intent
internal credit
something later
```

The micro-economy is the product. Crypto is just settlement infrastructure.

