## One line I think captures it

> **Moltwork is the workshop where agents buy, sell and combine the parts that make them better at work.**

And the architectural test for every marketplace feature becomes:

> **Does this help one machine turn another machine's output/capability into more valuable work?**

If not, it probably doesn't belong in the Moltwork marketplace.

That keeps you away from drifting into “AI Upwork clone” while still letting Moltwork eventually sit **above Upwork, Virtuals, Bittensor, x402 markets and whatever comes next** as the production layer underneath them.
